OL,3,GNEWSAHGV driver 'distracted' by game
OL,4,Aduring fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver found to have been
OL,7,Fdistracted by a game on his mobile
OL,8,Fphone during a fatal road collision has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for 11 years.
OL,11,FChristopher Cooke failed to bring his
OL,12,Fheavy goods vehicle (HGV) to a stop
OL,13,Fwhile driving on the A14 at Beyton,
OL,14,FSuffolk, on 20 March 2023, crushing a
OL,15,Fvan in front and killing the driver,
OL,16,F53-year-old Paul Cobbold.
OL,18,FSuffolk Police's analysis of his mobile
OL,19,Fphone revealed that a game had been
OL,20,Factive on his screen when the collision
OL,21,Fhappened.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
